    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0002044a30f10e9112bbba3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为生野狄杜斯笃定地告诉我：\n“改善的效果是有限的。”\n我才能赌一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94752b954e8f39f20be6a5d23fa4a3660c40c8ef78029707f6bb44c948754adc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
