      "uid": "zhcn:7d078d7d5b589862a59ce912",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说如此，她总是无法稳定入闸，\n心情不好的话还会畏缩或大闹……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de34066c167e07e40c5bf73bd297092c95e0a9714ecfd8045fe006a950a9553",
