      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我们在月下握手。没错，这份情谊，\n将帮助我们双方在闪耀系列赛过关斩将。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b3d474be03af13aca78ae7126d7124b524005592ef557805f69e5dc12a77800",
