      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老实说，我实在束手无策。\n虽然觉得必须从根本下手，改改她的个性才行，\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d80c662b9c436b809a9f3e1275891fdc329ce2622ab39713227e259df90653a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
